<title>ITALY: Stet index weight to be unchanged by Seat.</title>
<headline>Stet index weight to be unchanged by Seat.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighting of Italian state telecommunications group Stet will not change in Milan's blue-chip Mib30 index after the spin-off of its yellow pages unit Seat on January 2, 1997, a stock market advisory said.</p>
<p>However, the base price and the number of Stet ordinary shares will be modified.</p>
<p>The base price will be multiplied by the adjustment coefficient and the number of shares divided by the coefficient, which will be calculated on the first day of Seat's quotation.</p>
<p>-- Milan bureau +392 66129507</p>
</text>
